          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani jari sila isa himsisu maro tokotu isa biraa yae. Guddaani askartileeni, aka Pauloni ka inni sibiilaani hid'e gosa Rumi d'ageennaani sodaate.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.29",
